email_access_granted_body:
Hi,

Your access to the team {team} was approved. Open the team from the dashboard to start:

{link}

email_account_exists_body:
Hi,

Someone tried to sign up to Promptbook with this address, but you already have an account.

Sign in with your passkey: {signInLink}

Lost your passkeys? Recover access: {recoveryLink}

If this was not you, you can ignore this email.

email_engine_back_online_body:
Hi,

Your Promptbook engine is back online. It was offline for {duration}.

Engine: {label}
Address: {hostname}
Engine ID: {engineId}
Last heard from: {lastSeenAt}
Back online: {backOnlineAt}

Its status is on the engine page:

{link}

email_engine_offline_body:
Hi,

We have not heard from your Promptbook engine since {lastSeenAt}.

Engine: {label}
Address: {hostname}
Engine ID: {engineId}

Check that its server is running and connected to the internet. Its status is on the engine page:

{link}

We send this once per outage and let you know when the engine is back online.

email_engine_online_body:
Hi,

Your Promptbook engine is online.

Engine: {label}
Address: {hostname}
Engine ID: {engineId}

To finish setup, open the setup link in the engine's terminal. It makes you the engine's owner.

The engine page:

{link}
